<div class="section height--normal align--middle color--default col-gaps-bigger section-has-background"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h2 class="center">S Protelem jsou již spokojeni<span class="text-highlight">...</span></h2>
</div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-spacer"><div class="block-spacer-element" style="--height:50px"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="František Sedlák" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/frantisek-sedlak.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/frantisek-sedlak.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/frantisek-sedlak.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/frantisek-sedlak.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">
Na Protelu si cením především jeho spolehlivosti, podpory a množství nabízených reportů.
</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> František Sedlák <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">Grandhotel Brno, General Manager</span></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-5-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Iveta Spáčilová" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/iveta-spacilova.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/iveta-spacilova.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/iveta-spacilova.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/iveta-spacilova.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Protel je nejlepší systém, jaký jsme si mohli přát. Díky němu a skvělému týmu technické podpory rozvíjíme náš resort vpřed. Děkujeme vám a doporučujeme.</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Iveta Spáčilová <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">Resort Sobotín, Sales Manager</span></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-9-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Jan Dubský" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/jan-dubsky.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/jan-dubsky.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/jan-dubsky.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/jan-dubsky.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">U protelu je poměr cena-výkon skvělý a podpora prvotřídní.</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Jan Dubský <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">Old Town Hotels, CEO</span></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-spacer"><div class="block-spacer-element" style="--height:50px"></div></div></div></div>
